    "preview": "# Enterprise Data Governance Knowledge Guide for Database: card_games\n\n## 1. Introduction\nThis guide serves as a comprehensive semantic layer for the `card_games` database, providing a unified understanding of its structure, key entities, and business metrics. It is designed to ensure data governance standards are upheld, facilitating accurate data interpretation and usage across the enterprise.\n\n## 2. Core Entities & Fields\n\n### Cards\n- **ID (integer):** Unique identifier for each card.\n- **Artist (text):** Name of the artist who illustrated the card.\n- **Name (text):** Official name of the card.\n- **Border Color (text):** Color of the card's border, e.g., 'black', 'white', 'borderless'.\n- **Rarity (text):** Classification of card rarity, e.g., 'common', 'uncommon', 'rare', 'mythic'.\n- **Converted Mana Cost (real):** Total mana cost converted to a single value.\n- **Power (text):** Attack strength of the card, can be numeric or '*'.\n- **Toughness (text):** Defense strength of the card.\n- **Type (text):** Classification of the card, e.g., 'Artifact', 'Creature'.\n- **Format (text):** Play format legality, e.g., 'commander', 'vintage'.\n- **Status (text):** Legality status, e.g., 'Legal', 'Banned'.\n\n### Legalities\n- **Format (text):** Format of play, e.g., 'standard', 'modern'.\n- **Status (text):** Legal status in the format, e.g., 'Legal', 'Banned', 'Restricted'.\n\n### Foreign Data\n- **Language (text):** Language of the card's foreign version.\n- **Translation (text):** Translated name of the card.\n\n### Sets\n- **Name (text):** Name of the card set.\n- **Release Date (date):** Date when the set was released.\n- **Base Set Size (integer):** Number of cards in the base set.\n\n## 3. Metric Definitions\n\n### Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)\n- **Percentage of Cards in a Language:**\n  - **Formula:** `(Count of cards in specified language / Total count of cards) * 100`\n  - **Example:** Percentage of cards available in 'Chinese Simplified'.\n\n- **Percentage of Borderless Cards:**\n  - **Formula:** `(Count of borderless cards / Total count of cards) * 100`\n  - **Example:** Percentage of cards with 'borderless' border color.\n\n- **Rarity Distribution:**\n  - **Formula:** `(Count of cards by rarity / Total count of cards) * 100`\n  - **Example:** Distribution of 'mythic' rarity cards.\n\n- **Legal Status in Format:**\n  - **Formula:** `(Count of legal cards in format / Total count of cards in format) * 100`\n  - **Example:** Percentage of cards legal in 'commander' format.\n\n- **Artist Contribution:**\n  - **Formula:** `(Count of cards by artist / Total count of cards) * 100`\n  - **Example:** Contribution of 'Stephen Daniele' to the card set.\n\n## 4. Constraints & Conventions\n\n### Filtering Criteria\n- **Temporal Boundaries:** Use ISO 8601 format for dates.\n- **Currency Formatting:** Not applicable as there are no currency fields.\n- **Unit Conversion:** Not applicable as there are no unit fields.\n\n### Common Filters\n- **Language:** Filter by `language` for foreign data.\n- **Format:** Filter by `format` for legality status.\n- **Rarity:** Filter by `rarity` for card classification.\n\n## 5. Exemplar Use Cases\n\n### Use Case 1: Calculate the Percentage of Cards in 'Chinese Simplified'\n- **SQL Example:** `SELECT CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN language = 'Chinese Simplified' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS REAL) * 100 / COUNT(id) FROM cards;`\n- **Explanation:** This query calculates the percentage of cards available in 'Chinese Simplified' by dividing the count of such cards by the total count of cards.\n\n### Use Case 2: Determine the Distribution of 'Mythic' Rarity Cards\n- **SQL Example:** `SELECT (COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE rarity = 'mythic') / COUNT(*)) * 100 FROM cards;`\n- **Explanation:** This query calculates the percentage of 'mythic' rarity cards by dividing the count of 'mythic' cards by the total count of cards.\n\n### Use Case 3: Identify Legal Cards in 'Commander' Format\n- **SQL Example:** 